language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit EconomicPolicy.
unit ProductionAuthority.
unit BuckingCommandCoordinator.
capability DurableProduction.
capability BuckingStopCoordination.
capability EconomicDecisionContext.
functionality SelectEconomicPolicy.
functionality ValidateCutContext.
functionality RecordProductionFact.
functionality HandleBuckingStop.

BuckingService contains EconomicPolicy.
EconomicPolicy provides EconomicDecisionContext.
EconomicPolicy status proposed.
EconomicPolicy cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/DetailedArchitectureDiscussion.md".
EconomicPolicy owns SelectEconomicPolicy.
SelectEconomicPolicy realizes EconomicDecisionContext.
SelectEconomicPolicy specifies "Maintain separate BuckingPolicy, owner-value/settlement contract and source-bound interpretation revisions.".
ProductionAuthority owns ValidateCutContext.
ValidateCutContext realizes DurableProduction.
ValidateCutContext specifies "Require current calibration/policy/economics/APT/model/plan input lineage before a durable production decision.".
ProductionAuthority owns RecordProductionFact.
RecordProductionFact realizes DurableProduction.
RecordProductionFact specifies "Domain-owned durable cut/production fact and persistence; Lab ledger is optional diagnostic evidence, not its authority.".
BuckingCommandCoordinator owns HandleBuckingStop.
HandleBuckingStop realizes BuckingStopCoordination.
HandleBuckingStop specifies "Preserve stop occurrence identity when forwarding to Machine; cancel configured planning/control automation, invalidate queued old intents and avoid loops.".
BuckingService contains ProductionAuthority.
BuckingService contains BuckingCommandCoordinator.
ProductionAuthority provides DurableProduction.
BuckingCommandCoordinator provides BuckingStopCoordination.
